511
00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:03.447
 You know you can see us.

512
00:18:03.448 --> 00:18:06.283
 Fellas, we thought
 about it, and...

513
00:18:06.284 --> 00:18:07.852
 Well, here's
 your car back, man.

514
00:18:07.853 --> 00:18:08.919
 Thank you.

515
00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:11.022
 Thank you, Eczema.
 Thank you.

516
00:18:11.023 --> 00:18:13.757
 Yeah. We kinda felt bad
 for you guys.

517
00:18:13.758 --> 00:18:16.861
 Besides, our lawyers told us
 we couldn't keep the car.

518
00:18:16.862 --> 00:18:19.363
Good-looking, my nigga.
 My man, Ex-convict.

519
00:18:19.364 --> 00:18:21.264
 I always said you were
 my favorite rapper.

520
00:18:21.265 --> 00:18:22.867
I messes with Xzibit.

521
00:18:22.868 --> 00:18:25.235
 We'll just charge y'all
 for all the work we did on it:

522
00:18:25.236 --> 00:18:29.173
 $35,423.08.

523
00:18:29.174 --> 00:18:30.341
 [?]

524
00:18:30.342 --> 00:18:32.576
You Indian-giving-ass nigga.
 I hate you rappers,

525
00:18:32.577 --> 00:18:33.844
 with your bebop, bebop.

526
00:18:33.845 --> 00:18:35.847
 Why don't you exit
 out of my face, Exhibition.

527
00:18:35.848 --> 00:18:37.548
I do not mess with Xzibit.

528
00:18:37.549 --> 00:18:38.716
Bastard.

529
00:18:38.717 --> 00:18:40.718
 All right, here's
 the invoice.

530
00:18:40.719 --> 00:18:43.053
 And take your time with that.

531
00:18:43.054 --> 00:18:44.288
 Looks like money gonna be

532
00:18:44.289 --> 00:18:45.756
 tight around here
 for a minute.

533
00:18:45.757 --> 00:18:47.459
 [LAUGHS]

534
00:18:50.596 --> 00:18:52.396
She does look nice.

535
00:18:52.397 --> 00:18:53.898
 All things considered,

536
00:18:53.899 --> 00:18:55.667
 I say we came out ahead.

537
00:18:56.568 --> 00:18:58.170
 [GROWLING]

538
00:18:58.903 --> 00:18:59.870
 Uh-oh.

539
00:18:59.871 --> 00:19:00.872
 Come here!

540
00:19:01.506 --> 00:19:03.507
 [?]

541
00:19:06.511 --> 00:19:08.512
 I've come up
with a name for you:

542
00:19:08.513 --> 00:19:10.381
 The White Shadow.

543
00:19:10.382 --> 00:19:11.515
 Hm.

544
00:19:11.516 --> 00:19:14.618
 I'm white, I'm shadowing you.

545
00:19:14.619 --> 00:19:16.053
 It's very clever.

546
00:19:16.054 --> 00:19:17.788
 And I've decided
that you're a figment

547
00:19:17.789 --> 00:19:20.391
of my overactive imagination.

548
00:19:20.392 --> 00:19:22.393
 Now who's hiding
 from reality?

549
00:19:22.394 --> 00:19:24.394
 Just because
 you're paranoid, Huey,

550
00:19:24.395 --> 00:19:26.497
 doesn't mean
 we're not out to get you.

551
00:19:26.498 --> 00:19:28.231
 If you are real,

552
00:19:28.232 --> 00:19:29.667
 why me?

553
00:19:29.668 --> 00:19:32.603
 Oh, come on.

554
00:19:32.604 --> 00:19:35.039
 You underestimate yourself.

555
00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:38.209
 It's a shame what happened
 to the house.

556
00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.276
 You warned them.

557
00:19:39.277 --> 00:19:40.777
They wouldn't listen to me.

558
00:19:40.778 --> 00:19:42.546
They never listen to me.

559
00:19:42.547 --> 00:19:44.882
 I know you wanna save
 the world, Huey,

560
00:19:44.883 --> 00:19:46.617
 but sometimes people have

561
00:19:46.618 --> 00:19:48.085
 to learn lessons
 on their own.

562
00:19:48.086 --> 00:19:50.121
 The hard way.

563
00:19:50.122 --> 00:19:53.257
<i>Well, can't miss the Idol.</i>

564
00:19:53.258 --> 00:19:55.926
 If you ever wanna talk,
 remember...

565
00:19:55.927 --> 00:19:57.995
 I'm always listening.

566
00:19:57.996 --> 00:19:59.931
 ? Da-da
 Da-da-da-da...?

567
00:20:05.403 --> 00:20:07.471
<i>HUEY [NARRATING]:
 Obi-Wan Kenobi said:</i>

568
00:20:07.472 --> 00:20:10.407
<i>"Your eyes can deceive you.
 Don't trust them. "</i>

569
00:20:10.408 --> 00:20:13.944
 It seems to be getting harder
 distinguishing reality

570
00:20:13.945 --> 00:20:16.380
 from the illusions
 people make for us.

571
00:20:16.381 --> 00:20:19.049
<i>Or from the ones
 we make for ourselves.</i>

572
00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:21.619
<i>I don't know.
 Maybe that's part of the plan:</i>

573
00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:24.522
<i>To make me think I'm crazy.</i>

574
00:20:27.893 --> 00:20:29.628
<i>It's working.</i>

575
00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:33.664
 Anybody wanna drink
 out the fridge?

576
00:20:33.665 --> 00:20:35.366
 Or an espresso?

577
00:20:38.403 --> 00:20:40.170
 RILEY: Good night, Granddad.

578
00:20:40.171 --> 00:20:41.839
 I'll good your night.

579
00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.340
Good night, Huey.

580
00:20:43.341 --> 00:20:44.942
 Good night, Riley.

581
00:20:44.943 --> 00:20:48.212
 RILEY: Good night, Huey's
imaginary secret-agent friend.

582
00:20:48.213 --> 00:20:50.480
 [SNICKERS]

583
00:20:50.481 --> 00:20:53.250
 Granddad,
 Huey's imaginary friend

584
00:20:53.251 --> 00:20:55.352
 tried to touch me
 in a private place.

585
00:20:55.353 --> 00:20:56.553
 [LAUGHS]

586
00:20:56.554 --> 00:20:57.856
 [HUEY SIGHS]

587
00:21:01.159 --> 00:21:03.094
 [?]